----- Results: ------

*Review of Stage 2.* Excluding "the renaming of the cloned base repo to the gitGroup's name" means
=gitCloneBase= is no longer used for a gitGroup: the gitGroup directory becomes a plain directory,
and =base= and =.github= are cloned into it as members. That is the "Layout" bullet of gitist
DESIGN.org Step 2, done now in bisos.common as an interim; the rest of Step 2 (the gitGroupsSet
registry, =gitistGroup.cs=) is not part of this stage.

